1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,500
Don't you waste a single minute crying at the gate

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,420
Every single thing I did was just to make you great

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:12,100
When the hard days come to find you, take them on the chin

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:16,500
Keep your circle small and tight, and let the good ones in

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,860
Show up for each other the way I showed for you

6
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:23,940
Pull a chair up by the bed and stay the whole night through

7
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:27,620
So I'm handing you my stories and the lessons that I learned

8
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:35,540
All the roads I had to walk and the corners that I turned

9
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:37,060
I live on through you

10
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:39,220
In the way you hold your ground

11
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:42,900
In the way you take a hit and never make a sound

12
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:47,060
When you're sitting 'round the table telling stories like we do

13
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:50,580
You'll hear me in the laughter

14
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:54,260
I live on through you

15
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,160
When you're sitting 'round the table telling stories like we do
